                            <div class="bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-100 space-y-2">
                                <p class="text-sm font-medium text-indigo-700">3. The information has me wondering...</p>
                                <textarea data-key="refl3_ans" class="cloud-save w-full p-2 text-sm rounded border border-slate-200 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 outline-none" rows="2" placeholder="Type here..."></textarea>
                                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                    <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold whitespace-nowrap uppercase">Why this was important:</span>
                                    <input type="text" data-key="refl3_imp" class="cloud-save bg-transparent border-b border-slate-200 text-[10px] text-slate-500 italic w-full focus:border-indigo-400 outline-none" placeholder="Explain the significance...">
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-100 space-y-2">
                                <p class="text-sm font-medium text-indigo-700">4. Regarding the academic content, a key concept explained was...</p>
                                <textarea data-key="refl4_ans" class="cloud-save w-full p-2 text-sm rounded border border-slate-200 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 outline-none" rows="2" placeholder="Type here..."></textarea>
                                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                    <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold whitespace-nowrap uppercase">Why this was important:</span>
                                    <input type="text" data-key="refl4_imp" class="cloud-save bg-transparent border-b border-slate-200 text-[10px] text-slate-500 italic w-full focus:border-indigo-400 outline-none" placeholder="Explain the significance...">
                                </div>
